flowchart LR
  USER[User: Ask for research] --> DASH[Next.js Research Agent UI]
  DASH --> ROUTE[FastAPI agent SSE route]
  ROUTE --> MUSE[Muse Spark Responses function tools]
  MUSE --> GATE[Bounded tool dispatcher]
  GATE --> SEARCH[SearXNG local search]
  GATE --> PAGE[Read approved HTTPS page]
  GATE --> BROWSER[Read-only Playwright]
  GATE --> CALC[Bounded arithmetic]
  GATE --> DRAFT[Stage note proposal]
  DRAFT --> APPROVE{User explicitly approves?}
  APPROVE -- Yes --> NOTE[Local Markdown note]
  APPROVE -- No --> CANCEL[Discard]
  SEARCH --> MUSE
  PAGE --> MUSE
  BROWSER --> MUSE
  CALC --> MUSE
  DRAFT --> MUSE
  MUSE --> RESULT[Final response + sources + audit steps]
  RESULT --> DASH
